","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6bp2Emcb08eahoHRJ6yHPw","review_id":"SL4aKhoDx1arrzEJkYtXbQ","date":"2015-04-14T19:36:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945335865020752,"text_excerpt":"My SO and I wanted some hibachi for a personal celebration, and being limited to Shogun on Vets or Miyako as our only two real options, we went with Miyako. I'm not sure why the ratings are so poor, but we definitely enjoyed our experience. We got the chicken hibachi and steak hibachi, each coming with clear soup, a small asian salad, a two shrimp appetizer, fried rice ($3.50 extra), noodles, and veggies. That's a LOT of food, but good riddance, for $20-25, it better be a lot. We were seated on one end of the grill table, and two girls (maybe on a date too????) were seated at the other end. The chef was an older gentleman, but was still enthusiastic enough. And my SO and I were way more i..."},{"business_id":"6bp2Emcb08eahoHRJ6yHPw","review_id":"h3nFxMYgyQPyvT84xWmB8w","date":"2014-12-29T04:39:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9400659203529358,"text_excerpt":"Been here before and I'm just sitting to review... oh well, no time like the present. So here we go: A sushi & hibachi restaurant that creates total ambiance upon entrance. Coming with a group, we called ahead to ensure seating. We were required to wait for all group members before being seated, this seems to be the norm as of late. AnyWHO, once seated, our order was taken & the hibachi was on & poppin. Entertainment by the hibachi chef was quite the thrill. From hiding eggs in his toque hat, to popping shrimp & steak into our mouths with his cooking utensils. How cool, huh!!!! I've seen this before, but it is always amazing to see the precision with which this feat is performed. So on to..."},{"business_id":"6bp2Emcb08eahoHRJ6yHPw","review_id":"u8lOkKOeTEc3g7xHYRXnWQ","date":"2011-07-25T16:54:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9385984539985657,"text_excerpt":"I love a good Hibachi meal. It's always fun for me. If I want to go for Hibachi, this is the place I prefer out of the whole city to go to. It's pretty inside and I've never had a problem with the staff's service. Always a good time!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6bp2Emcb08eahoHRJ6yHPw","photo_id":"CqlQIm48NagJ6w-X_1ZPjg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CqlQIm48NagJ6w-X_1ZPjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9113893508911133},{"business_id":"6bp2Emcb08eahoHRJ6yHPw","photo_id":"0pRgkf69qeDK8tCqBP9R0g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0pRgkf69qeDK8tCqBP9R0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8685428500175476},{"business_id":"6bp2Emcb08eahoHRJ6yHPw","photo_id":"tuWXcLjuMognqf5XL3Ffow","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tuWXcLjuMognqf5XL3Ffow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8116634488105774}]},"notebook_case":null}
